// docs/agents.md and AGENTS.md content.
page("docs/agents.md",[h(1,"Agent card"),"Fetch only what you need:",
  code("sh",["nanoc --describe syntax              # small syntax/phase card","nanoc --describe replace             # one builtin","nanoc --describe builtins            # complete signatures","nanoc unit.nc --check --diagnostics json","nanoc unit.nc -o unit.c --diagnostics json","cc -std=c11 -Wall -Wextra -Werror -pedantic-errors unit.c -o unit"]),
  ul(["Checks validate expansion, not C/C++ types/linking/runtime. Then compile and test.",
    "`--check` never writes generated code and rejects BT host effects. Normal builds execute BT effects; `--no-effects` disables them.",
    "Success check JSON: schemaVersion, ok, file, validation, language, generatedBytes, symbols, passes, logs, diagnostics.",
    "Errors: one JSON object on stderr, nonzero exit. Diagnostics contain code, file, line, message, trace. Codes: NC_SYNTAX, NC_LIMIT, NC_INPUT. Schema v1 is additive.",
    "Use `@f add(int a,b) int = a+b` or an indented final expression; no arrows/braces/block colons/semicolons.",
    "CT/macros generate/edit code; BT adds host files/commands. `rewrite` converges on unchanged text; `again` forces a pass; `--max-passes 0 --max-steps 0` removes count limits.",
    "Preserve raw C/C++ for unsupported declarators. Assembly: `--describe asm`."])])
page("AGENTS.md",[h(1,"NanoC agent entry"),
  ul(["Everything is NanoC under `src/`; `build.c` is the only C source. Docs, editors, headers and the website are generated by `src/*.bt.nc` (`./builder docs`).",
    "Compiler modules: `src/**/*.nc`, at most "+LIMIT+" lines, doc comment per function. Edit NanoC; never hand-edit generated seed C or generated docs.",
    "Preserve unmarked C/C++. New code uses `@f name(args) int`, bare types and indentation: no arrows, block colons, braces or semicolons.",
    "Bootstrap: `cc -std=c11 -O2 build.c -o builder`; `./builder test`; `./builder bootstrap` byte-compares three generations. Refresh seed: `./builder snapshot`, then `./builder bootstrap`.",
    "Sanitizers: `CC=clang ./builder test --sanitize`.",
    "Language lookup: `build/nanoc --describe syntax|builtins|asm|NAME`. Repair loop: `nanoc input.nc --check --diagnostics json`.",
    "`--check` validates expansion only and disables BT writes/commands. `--max-passes 0 --max-steps 0` removes count limits.",
    "Builtin metadata lives in `src/meta/registry.nc`. Layout: `docs/architecture.md`. Keep upstream corpus/license/hash files intact."])])
